{"speciesId":764,"names":{"fr":"Guérilande","es":"Comfey","en":"Comfey","ja":"キュワワー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sa liane gluante diffuse des nutriments dans les fleurs qu’elle happe. Ces dernières dégagent alors un léger parfum."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Prende flores en su tallo, que es muy rico en nutrientes. Las flores se revitalizan y desprenden una agradable fragancia."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It attaches flowers to its highly nutritious vine. This revitalizes the flowers, and they give off an aromatic scent."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"栄養満点の ツルに 花を くっつける。 花は 活性化し 香しい アロマが 漂いだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Utilisées en bain, les fleurs qui se collent sur sa liane possèdent des vertus relaxantes. Elles ont déjà séduit les gens du monde entier."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Un baño aderezado con las flores ensartadas en su sarmiento tiene un efecto muy relajante, por lo que este Pokémon se ha vuelto muy popular."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Baths prepared with the flowers from its vine have a relaxing effect, so this Pokémon is a hit with many people."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ツルに ついた 花を 浮かべた お風呂は リラックス効果が あり 多くの 女性に 大人気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il ramasse des fleurs en déployant la liane gluante accrochée à sa tête et s’en agrémente. Il se sent mal à l’aise lorsqu’il n’en a pas."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Adorna con flores el tallo pegajoso que brota de su cabeza. Sin ellas se siente intranquilo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It stretches sticky vines out from its head and picks flowers to adorn itself with. When it doesn’t have any flowers, it feels uneasy."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"頭から 粘り気の ある ツルを 伸ばして 花を 摘んで 自分を 飾る。 花が ないと 不安。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il cueille des fleurs qu’il colle sur son corps grâce à ses fluides corporels. Le parfum qui émane de ses pétales a des vertus apaisantes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Prende flores en su tallo usando sus fluidos corporales. El aroma que desprenden los pétalos tiene propiedades curativas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It picks flowers and sticks them to its body with fluids it produces. The aroma that wafts from its petals has a healing effect."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"摘んだ 花を 体液で 身体に くっつける。 花弁から ただよう 香りには 癒しの 効果がある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il orne son corps de fleurs qu’il cueille avec sa liane. Mystérieusement, celles-ci ne se fanent jamais."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Prende flores en su tallo para decorar su propio cuerpo y, misteriosamente, no se marchitan nunca."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Comfey picks flowers with its vine and decorates itself with them. For some reason, flowers won’t wither once they’re attached to a Comfey."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ツルを 使って 花を 摘み 自分を 飾る。 体に ついた 花は なぜか 枯れない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon dégage un parfum agréable qui varie d’un spécimen à l’autre, car chaque Guérilande s’habille de fleurs différentes."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Este Pokémon libera una agradable fragancia, que varía de individuo a individuo debido a que cada uno se engalana con flores diferentes."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"These Pokémon smell very nice. All Comfey wear different flowers, so each of these Pokémon has its own individual scent."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"とても 良い香りがする ポケモン。 身につける 花が 違うので キュワワーごとに 香りは 違う。"}],"varieties":[{"id":764,"moves":[{"name":"bind","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"level-up",36]]},{"name":"vine-whip","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",3],[25,"level-up",3]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16],[20,"level-up",1],[2